SUMMARY:ORIGIN BALI: One Morning. Many Seeds
LOCATION:The Yoga Barn
DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, 17 October 2026\, The Yoga Barn will proudly host
  ORIGIN\, a global movement gathering people from all corners of the globe
  to care for the Earth through 108 minutes of yoga\, meditation\, and soun
 d. A morning of reconnection will run as follows: Heart Opening Asana with
  Wayan Marcus\, Guided Meditation with Jana Johnson\, and Beauty Prayer an
 d Sound Healing with Shervin Boloorian ORIGIN has held over 140 gatherings
  worldwide under a flagship festival at the Cradle of Humankind in South A
 frica. Now\, it’s time for Bali to join this global moment through The Y
 oga Barn. Held from 7 AM to 9 AM \, the event will also include a fundrais
 ing event to support community environmental work on the island\, led by B
 ali ReGreen in partnership with Friends of Nature\, People and Forests (FN
 PF).\n\nMore info: https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/origin-bali-o
 ne-morning-many-seeds/\n\nPlease verify with the organizer before attendin
