SUMMARY:Steps of Hope: Breast Cancer Charity Walk
LOCATION:Sudamala Resort Sanur
DESCRIPTION:October is Breast Cancer Awareness Month\, also known as ‘ Pi
 nktober ’\, a global health campaign that draws crucial attention to thi
 s life-threatening disease\, promotes education\, and encourages early det
 ection. Bali Pink Foundation invites you to join its fundraising charity w
 alk on Saturday\, 17 October 2026. Founded in 2013 by breast cancer surviv
 or Gaye Warren\, Bali Pink Ribbon Foundation has since screened and provid
 ed treatment to thousands of women across Indonesia. Throughout the year\,
  the foundation organises regular breast cancer awareness programmes and b
 reast screenings for local communities in Bali and beyond. ‘Steps of Hop
 e’ \, in collaboration with Sudamala Resort Sanur \, is the foundation
 ’s annual fundraising event. This ‘Pink Charity Fun Walk and Run’ br
 ings people together for a morning walk in Sanur\, fully dressed in pink\,
  to raise awareness of breast cancer in solidarity with the foundation and
  other survivors.\n\nMore info: https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/
 steps-of-hope-breast-cancer-charity-walk/\n\nPlease verify with the organi
 zer before attending.
URL:https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/steps-of-hope-breast-cancer-c
 harity-walk/
