SUMMARY:Beatland World Beatbox Battle 2026
LOCATION:BLOCK42 at NUANU\, Beraban\, Kediri\, Tabanan
DESCRIPTION:BEATLAND WORLD BEATBOX BATTLE 2026 17 OCTOBER 2026 · BLOCK 42 
 · NUANU CREATIVE CITY · BALI Doors 13:30 · Battles and showcases until 
 22:00 · Afterparty 23:00–02:00 One night\, one stage: the finals of bot
 h categories — solo and loopstation — judged by ten world champions\, 
 showcases\, hip-hop legends ONYX live\, and an afterparty until 02:00. The
  day opens with Seven to Smoke — an open battle where the winner stays o
 n stage and the next challenger steps up. Included in every ticket. TICKET
 S STUDENTS · school and university students\, everyone under 18 Student &
  Under 18 Rp 50\,000 LOCAL · Indonesian citizens General Admission Rp 150
 \,000 Fan Zone Rp 200\,000 General Admission + Afterparty Rp 250\,000 Fan 
 Zone + Afterparty Rp 300\,000 VIP Rp 750\,000 TOURIST · foreign guests Ge
 neral Admission Rp 250\,000 Fan Zone Rp 300\,000 General Admission + After
 party Rp 350\,000 Fan Zone + Afterparty Rp 400\,000 VIP Rp 900\,000 TABLES
  · sold as a whole table EXCLUSIVE TABLE · 5 seats Rp 7\,500\,000 per ta
 ble General Admission — standing area\, full view of the stage Fan Zone 
 — closest to the stage\, limited places VIP — tiers facing the stage i
 n VIP 1 and VIP 2 where you sit or stand\, separate entrance\, welcome dri
 nk\, afterparty included EXCLUSIVE TABLE · 5 seats — VIP 1\, centre of 
 the hall\, behind the artists’ rows. Buy 1 ticket\, get 5 QR tickets (1 
 + 4). Only five tables on sale: A1 to A5 STUDENT & UNDER 18 — school and
  university students and anyone under 18\, General Admission area\, no aft
 erparty Prices exclude the Megatix booking fee (3 %\, min Rp 5\,000)\, add
 ed at checkout. Prices rise in waves as the hall fills — buying early lo
 cks in today’s price. LOCAL — Indonesian citizens\, KTP checked at the
  door. TOURIST — all foreign guests\, including KITAS and KITAP holders\
 , passport checked at the door. A foreign passport with a LOCAL ticket: pa
 y the difference to the TOURIST price at the door. Afterparty is included 
 only in + Afterparty\, VIP and table tickets. The show in Block 42 ends at
  22:00\; the afterparty starts at 23:00 right next door — Ash Odyssey\, 
 10 metres from the hall — and runs until 02:00\, entry by wristband. Tab
 les are sold whole (5 seats) — for yourself or your crew\, each guest ge
 ts a ticket. Drinks are not included\; extras will be announced separately
 . The front rows of VIP 1 are reserved for artists\, partners and the team
 . Five tables are on sale — A1 to A5 in VIP 1. Each table is its own tic
 ket: buy 1 and you get 5 QR tickets (1 + 4) to forward to your crew. No ag
 e limit to enter\; alcohol is sold only to guests 21+ with a valid ID. INS
 IDE BLOCK 42 One hall\, one stage\, three zones. Three bars\, partner shop
 s and a lounge on the left\, merch and the press wall in the entrance hall
 . VIP has its own entrance and two areas: VIP 1 in the centre with tables\
 , and VIP 2 upstairs — calmer\, with a small kids corner on its right si
 de. The updated floor plan will be posted here soon. FAN ZONE. Right at th
 e heart of the action\, closest to the stage — where you feel every beat
  land and share each moment with the artists. This is where the loudest cr
 owd stands and where the battlers look first. GENERAL ADMISSION. For those
  who came to move. Open standing area with a full view of the stage — da
 nce\, cheer and take in nine hours of world-class beatboxing with the best
  energy in the room. VIP. Tiers facing the stage where VIP guests sit or s
 tand\, with tables behind them\, a clear view of the stage\, a separate en
 trance and unhurried access to everything happening on stage. The judges s
 it right in front of VIP 1. Tables of 5 in VIP 1 — the front rows are re
 served for artists and partners\, five tables (A1 to A5) are on sale. VIP 
 2 upstairs is calmer\, with a small kids corner on its right side. PROGRAM
 ME OF THE DAY 13:30 Doors open 14:00 Welcome — host SCOTT JACKSON · IND
 OBEATBOX showcase 14:15 SEVEN TO SMOKE — open battle 15:15 Showcases: SU
 AVE-SKI · DHARNI · SKILLER · RIVER · VAHTANG · MAD TWINZ · JEFF TURN
 ER 16:44 SOLO semifinals: REMIX vs OSIS · ACAR vs MARVELOUS ·\n\nMore in
 fo: https://baligasm.com/event/block42-at-nuanu-beatland-world-beatbox-bat
 tle-oct-2026\n\nPlease verify with the organizer before attending.
URL:https://baligasm.com/event/block42-at-nuanu-beatland-world-beatbox-batt
 le-oct-2026
