DESCRIPTION:The Padma Musical Series George Harliono & Hera Hyesang Park Pa
 dma Resort Legian\, Bali — Saturday\, 12 December 2026 The Padma Musical
  Series concludes the year with one of the most distinguished classical pa
 irings ever to grace a Bali stage. George Harliono needs no introduction t
 o Padma audiences. The British-Indonesian pianist and Silver Medallist at 
 the XVII International Tchaikovsky Competition returns following his unfor
 gettable appearance at the series. Having performed at the Royal Albert Ha
 ll\, Wigmore Hall\, Berlin Philharmonie\, Suntory Hall and Chicago Symphon
 y Center\, George has established himself as one of the most distinctive p
 ianists of his generation. Joining him is Hera Hyesang Park — the acclai
 med Korean soprano celebrated by the Financial Times as a ‘pristine\, di
 amond-cut soprano.’ An exclusive Deutsche Grammophon recording artist\, 
 she has performed at the Metropolitan Opera\, Staatsoper Berlin\, Glyndebo
 urne Festival and Paris Opéra\, as well as alongside the New York Philhar
 monic\, Los Angeles Philharmonic and Vienna Symphony. Her Bali debut promi
 ses to be something truly special. Together\, they promise an unforgettabl
 e evening of extraordinary musicianship\, vocal brilliance and artistic ch
 emistry. ● 20% discount for BCA card holders ● 40% discount for genera
 l seating in the BRONZE section purchased with a student ID Tickets: https
 ://megatix.co.id/events/george-harliono-hera-hyesang-park\n\nMore info: ht
 tps://baligasm.com/event/padma-resort-legian-george-harliono-hera-hyesang-
 park-dec-2026\n\nPlease verify with the organizer before attending.
